activity Collect Data
activity Analyze Data
activity Draft Report
activity Review Report
activity Approve Report
activity Publish Report
activity Gather Feedback
activity Revise Report
bind Collect Data: Data Points
bind Analyze Data: Report Accuracy
bind Approve Report: Approval Status
bind Gather Feedback: Feedback Type
bind Revise Report: Revision Count
Data Points: integer between 100 and 10000
Report Accuracy: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Approval Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Feedback Type: Positive, Negative, Neutral
Revision Count: integer between 0 and 10
Init[Collect Data] | |
End[Gather Feedback] | |
Existence[Analyze Data] | |
Absence11[Revise Report] | |
Exactly[Approve Report] | |
Responded Existence[Gather Feedback, Revise Report] | | |
Precedence[Analyze Data, Collect Data] | | |
Precedence[Publish Report, Approve Report] |A.Approval Status is Approved | |
Response[Draft Report, Review Report] | | |
Response[Review Report, Approve Report] | | |
Succession[Approve Report, Publish Report] |A.Approval Status is Approved | |
Alternate Response[Gather Feedback, Revise Report] | | |
Chain Response[Revise Report, Review Report] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Approve Report, Publish Report] |A.Approval Status is Rejected | |
Not Responded Existence[Collect Data, Revise Report] | | |
Not Precedence[Publish Report, Draft Report] | | |
Not Response[Publish Report, Draft Report] | | |